sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S1 as SYN
    participant S2 as SYN-ACK
    participant S3 as ACK
    participant Server
    
    Note over C,Server: TCP Three-Way Handshake
    
    C->>Server: SYN seq=x
    Note over C: SYN_SENT state
    Note over Server: SYN_RECEIVED state
    
    Server->>C: SYN-ACK seq=y ack=x+1
    
    C->>Server: ACK ack=y+1
    Note over C: ESTABLISHED state
    Note over Server: ESTABLISHED state
    
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over C,Server: Connection established, Data can flow
    end
    
    C->>Server: Data seq=x+1
    Server->>C: ACK ack=x+data_len
    
    Server->>C: Data seq=y+1
    C->>Server: ACK ack=y+data_len
    
    Note over C,Server: Connection Termination (4-way)
    
    C->>Server: FIN seq=x+n
    Note over C: FIN_WAIT_1
    
    Server->>C: ACK ack=x+n+1
    Note over C: FIN_WAIT_2
    Note over Server: CLOSE_WAIT
    
    Server->>C: FIN seq=y+m
    Note over Server: LAST_ACK
    
    C->>Server: ACK ack=y+m+1
    Note over C: TIME_WAIT 2MSL
    Note over Server: CLOSED
